# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CRITICAL — never commit these (secrets, keys, credentials)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
*.pem
*.pem.pub
*.key
*accessKeys*
*credentials*
.aws/
# AWS CLI install artifacts in labs
aws/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TERRAFORM — state files contain sensitive data in plain text
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Provider binaries + modules cache (huge, machine-specific)
.terraform/
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info

# State files — can contain passwords, private keys, IPs
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup

# Variable files — contain account IDs and secrets
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
# ...but DO commit example/template files
!*.tfvars.example

# Crash logs
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Plan output files
*.tfplan

# Override files (local-only customizations)
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# KEEP: .terraform.lock.hcl — this SHOULD be committed so teammates
# get the exact same provider versions. Do not ignore it.

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PYTHON — virtual environments and caches
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
venv/
env/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.Python

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LAB DATA — sample CSVs and test files (kept locally only)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Be selective: some labs generate test data that shouldn't be pushed.
# Review before committing any *.csv file.
*.csv

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PROJECT-SPECIFIC — local-only (not pushed to repo)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Claude Code project instructions (local only)
CLAUDE.md
# Training PDFs (course material, kept local)
LABS_GUIDES/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# IDE / editor / OS clutter
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
